# Nested repositories — these have their own git history and GitHub remotes.
# Tracked separately, not embedded in this repo.
# Using **/ prefixes so these match regardless of nesting depth (they moved
# one level deeper on 2026-08-13 into space work (blogging)/, and the plain
# unanchored patterns below stopped matching at that point without anyone
# noticing until the 2026-08-14 commit caught it before it landed).
**/blogs/canada-subn-1/smallspacehome/
**/blogs/uk-subn-1/britishhomeinterior/
**/blogs/australia-subn-1/website/
**/blogging ressources/claude-blog/
**/blogging ressources/claude-seo/
**/blogging ressources/hormozi-skills/
**/blogging ressources/marketingskills/
**/blogging ressources/ai-marketing-skills/

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
.vercel/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated ebook PDFs + build artifacts — regenerable from rewritten/ + build.mjs,
# kept on disk but not in git history (was bloating .git on every rebuild)
digital prod/resources/ebook-pdf-builder/output/

# Secrets and local config
.env
.env.*
*.local
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp

# Local runtime state
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

.vercel
.env*

# Nested repo — own git history, own GitHub remote (badreddineX/prosperity-press-digital-prod)
space work (digital prod)/
